# Normalise line endings so the shell scripts and JSON stay LF everywhere.
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites them as CRLF and the build tooling
# sees spurious diffs (and `#!/bin/sh` scripts break on Unix).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
*.bin binary
*.spm binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
